        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "\n6) So far as the first ground of challenge is concerned, a perusal of the detention record would show that in terms of receipt executed by the petitioner, he has received only grounds of detention consisting of three leaves."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "8d2d3515dc534cfcb46740e1ebae9aa4_20",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "That means, copies of PSA warrant, notice of detention and order of detention have not been provided to the petitioner."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "c131b61040074baa86851910d31849ff_21",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Even the copy of the dossier of detention has not been supplied to the petitioner."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "bd3de28ad98a49e59a04e597eab57e47_32",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "The particulars of the period when the detenue is alleged to have provided food, shelter and other logistic support to the alleged terrorists are also not mentioned in the grounds of detention."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "ca4103844d8a4a8a8b5c48d47dd9e3ce_33",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Thus,\nthe grounds, being vague and lacking in material particulars, the detenue could not have made an effective representation against his detention."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "68ba72370b53451b83caba62f70b9451_34",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Therefore, there has been violation of constitutional guarantees envisaged under Article 22(5) of the Constitution."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "337ef5f7bef8482b828b98c9f10bd9a6_35",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "The detention order, as such, is illegal and unsustainable."
      },
      {
