        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "In my aforesaid view, I am fortified by the judgments of the Supreme Court in the case of Jahangirkhan Fazal Khan Pathan vs. Police Commissioner, Ahmadabad, (1989) 3 SCC 590, Abdul Razak Nane khan Pathan v. Police Commissioner, Ahmadabad, A"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "c0367b8094604cb881db74329ed14cac_38",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "\n11) In the above context, the petitioner has placed on record a copy of the representation dated 30.01.2023 along with his writ petition (Annexure- III)."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "7ff3e48ea91a461cb69e2029a0bba24c_39",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "He has also placed on record postal receipts dated 06.02.2023, which indicates that the representation has been sent to the Additional Chief Secretary to Government, Home Department and District Magistrate, Shopian."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "e5396f757e5c4eb2a8de319f68ab4d3e_40",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "A perusal of the detention record reveals that the respondents have received the representation of the petitioner."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "33009e6720f64d78b49934a0dc06628d_41",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "\nThis is evident from communication dated 13.02.2023, addressed by Deputy Secretary to Government, Home Department, to the Special DIG of Police, CID, J&K, as also from the communication dated 20.05.2023, addressed by Special DIG of Police,"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "3662a7ebf57c4c1190dbdc3db207d24d_42",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "The detention record suggests that the said representation has been considered by the Government."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "8a9ab1924fe64985bc95bc412bf0d75c_43",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "The record shows that report regarding representation of the petitioner was called by the Government, whereafter it has been rejected."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "9e228b02597b452d818573af44eeec7e_44",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "This is evident from communication dated 24.05.2023 addressed by Home Department of the Government to the District Magistrate, Shopian."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "939b37d8c1aa432d8f83d28bd1c5406b_45",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "12) The respondents have not placed on record anything to show that the order of rejection of representation was conveyed to the petitioner."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "793163f8f92b4c0f9d0889ae5744e0b9_46",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "The communication dated 24.04.2023 is an inter-departmental communication between Home Department and the District Magistrate."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "ecb9000beb9a48c985d88f0fa79f5d47_47",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "It is not coming Page |6 forth from the record produced by the respondents as to whether the result of the representation has been conveyed to the petitioner."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "d2f2e3b4c144428283b98e54b00ec0e3_48",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "PRE_RELIED"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "\n13) The Supreme Court in the case of Sarabjeet Singh Mokha vs. District Magistrate, Jabalpur and others\" (2021) 20 SCC 98, while dealing with the effect of failure to communicate the result of the representation has held that failure in ti"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "2b87f1bb5da64b74aed5edf2859be3a7_49",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "It has been further held that failure of the government to communicate rejection of detenue's representation in a time bound manner is sufficient to vitiate the detention order."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "3d4ebd0dc2844c75bf76d057ac3fe816_50",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "PRE_RELIED"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "\nRafiq Ahmad Thoker vs Ut Of J&K & Ors on 27 December, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/166132685/\n3 14)"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "17d6a12170dc45e1b90bfc382754e3d1_51",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "PRE_RELIED"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "In the said case, the Supreme Court has further held that the delay in decision on the representation of the detenue amounts to an infringement of a valuable right which is available to a detenue in terms of provisions contained in Section "
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "a457f559ee8047ce9b3ef5b8ee7aa3a1_52",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "The purpose of furnishing the grounds of detention within a maximum period of ten days is to enable a detenue to make a representation against the order of detention at the earliest opportunity."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "3b213ff2a7984a6f8fa91fc82db59432_53",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Thus, a duty is cast upon the detaining authority or the government to consider the said representation at the earliest opportunity."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "df57065c69ed4059b7968ece57233e23_54",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Failure to decide the representation of a detenue within a reasonable time in an expeditious manner strikes at the valuable right of a detenue emanating from the Page |7 provisions of Section 13 of the Jammu & Kashmir Public Safety Act."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "d6e48fa978be4763a3434d06c7f25153_55",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "In my aforesaid view."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "b5d3c279c34a48c9a6498c967cd14869_56",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "RATIO"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "\n15) In the present case, the record shows that the respondents have received the representation of the petitioner at best in the second week of February, 2023 and the rejection of the representation has ben conveyed to the District Magistr"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "cde87c39dfac42a190fa0055fabbf766_57",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "RATIO"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "As already stated, the result of consideration of representation has not been conveyed to the detenue."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "3c79a4383af4485aae4ba8886a01c3d1_58",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "RATIO"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "\nThus, besides there being undue delay in consideration of the representation of the detenue, even the result of the same has not been conveyed to him."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "f044e8356c7a4441997a78e1133a0d66_59",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "RATIO"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "This is sufficient to vitiate the impugned order of detention."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "d4e385373336422db20f314eaa11e479_60",
        "summary_section": "decision",
        "labels": [
          "RPC"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:decision",
          "forbidden_labels:RPC",
          "suspicious_label:rpc",
          "explicit_leakage_phrase"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [
          {
            "pattern": "\\bpetition\\s+is\\s+allowed\\b",
            "matched_text": "petition is allowed",
            "start": 36,
            "end": 55
          },
          {
            "pattern": "\\bquashed\\b",
            "matched_text": "quashed",
            "start": 95,
            "end": 102
          }
        ],
        "text_preview": "\n16) For the foregoing reasons, the petition is allowed and the impugned order of detention is quashed."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "227336f2db3d48b1b1adb48520e4b1b3_61",
        "summary_section": "decision",
        "labels": [
          "RPC"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:decision",
          "forbidden_labels:RPC",
          "suspicious_label:rpc"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "The detenue is directed to be released from the preventive custody forthwith provided he is not required in connection with any other case."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "2360e0b59b57406ca9fc731c70d76b03_62",
        "summary_section": "decision",
        "labels": [
          "RPC"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:decision",
          "forbidden_labels:RPC",
          "suspicious_label:rpc"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "\n17) The detention record be returned to the learned counsel for the respondents."
      }
